0:{"buildId":"HaSH0nfWkwbFYqcaqq3RQ","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"x:mx-auto x:flex x:max-w-(--nextra-content-width)","children":["$","$L2",null,{"value":[{"value":"Property","id":"property","depth":2},{"value":"Type","id":"type","depth":2},{"value":"Possible Values","id":"possible-values","depth":2},{"value":"Usage","id":"usage","depth":2},{"value":"Notes","id":"notes","depth":2},{"value":"Related Properties","id":"related-properties","depth":2}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{}],["$","$L4",null,{"metadata":{"title":"chainType","filePath":"content/hooks/useAccount/chainType.mdx","timestamp":1770719093000},"sourceCode":"# chainType\n\nThe type of blockchain the wallet is currently connected to.\n\n## Property\n\n`chainType?: ChainType`\n\n## Type\n\n`\"evm\" | \"dogecoin\" | undefined`\n\n## Possible Values\n\n- `\"evm\"` - EVM-compatible chains (Ethereum, Polygon, BSC, etc.)\n- `\"dogecoin\"` - Dogecoin blockchain\n\n## Usage\n\n```tsx\n  import { useAccount } from \"__PACKAGE_NAME__\";\n\n  function ChainTypeDisplay() {\n  const { chainType, address } = useAccount();\n\n  if (!address) {\n    return <div>Not connected</div>;\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <div>Chain Type: {chainType || \"Unknown\"}</div>\n    </div>\n  );\n  }\n\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Returns `undefined` if wallet is not connected\n- Chain type determines which methods and features are available\n- Different chain types have different address formats and RPC methods\n\n## Related Properties\n\n- `chainId` - Current chain ID\n- `address` - Wallet address\n- `currentProvider` - Current wallet provider","children":[["$","div",null,{"id":"nextra-skip-nav"}],["$","main",null,{"data-pagefind-body":true,"children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-bold x:mt-2 x:text-4xl","children":["chainType","$undefined"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":"The type of blockchain the wallet is currently connected to."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"property","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Property",["$","$L5",null,{"id":"property"}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":["$","$L6",null,{"children":"chainType?: ChainType"}]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"type","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Type",["$","$L5",null,{"id":"type"}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":["$","$L6",null,{"children":"\"evm\" | \"dogecoin\" | undefined"}]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"possible-values","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Possible Values",["$","$L5",null,{"id":"possible-values"}]]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"x:[:is(ol,ul)_&]:my-[.75em] x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:list-disc x:ms-[1.5em]","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"x:my-[.5em]","children":[["$","$L6",null,{"children":"\"evm\""}]," - EVM-compatible chains (Ethereum, Polygon, BSC, etc.)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"x:my-[.5em]","children":[["$","$L6",null,{"children":"\"dogecoin\""}]," - Dogecoin blockchain"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"usage","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Usage",["$","$L5",null,{"id":"usage"}]]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-6 mt-4 ml-6","children":["$","pre",null,{"className":"pl-5 pr-5 py-5 text-sm leading-relaxed border border-[var(--heroui-content2)] rounded